    "cid": "3111",
    "title": "玩法介绍",
    "category": 4,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·主题介绍</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"166\" alt=\"3-1.png\" title=\"3-1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/9ca8c535d60b0ad40121789a5d6fd2dd.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#adadad\">在集成战略</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异】</span><span style=\"color:#adadad\">中，您将在变幻莫测的界园中探索岁兽与其代理人相关的故事。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#adadad\">合理利用通宝构筑钱盒，规划伺烛客人选，挖掘岁兽残识中的宝藏，提升小队实力，对抗岁时带来的考验。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·难度分级</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"167\" alt=\"3-1-1.png\" title=\"3-1-1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/1c769f44758a531719c4f6ad8ac3d8d7.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在本次</span></span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异】</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">集成战略主题中，“请君入园”提供15个扩展难度等级，每完成一个难度等级时，下一个难度等级也会随之解锁。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">随等级提升将面临更严峻的战斗环境，是对硬实力、策略与运气的更高考验，也能收获更高效的奖励积累和更高荣誉的结局标志。 </span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">岁时</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">随着难度提升，会遇到效果更强的岁时。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">多元奇物</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当请君入园的等级达到</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">3、6、9</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">级时，</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">多元奇物</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的效果会有一定程度的提升。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">分队</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当请君入园的等级达到</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">3、6、9</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">级时，部分</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">分队效果</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">会有一定程度的提升。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">古今学识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">解锁难度节点后，在对应难度及以上探险时，可以获得对应增益。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">· 分队和招募</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"168\" alt=\"3-1-2.png\" title=\"3-1-2.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/12a0e13fe16b7a3c324d68cecbbf5114.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">探险开始时，您需要选择本次的</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探险分队</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，不同的分队将会为您提供不同的战术效果。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">本次集成战略</span></span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">中您将有丰富的小队种类可供选择，完成不同的分队解锁条件即可解锁更多分队。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">同时，本次集成战略中部分分队随着难度提升会获得强化效果。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">选择心仪的招募组合进行</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">初始招募</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">来决定本次跟随您前往界园进行探险的第一批干员。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在探险过程中，您将有许多机会获得不同职业的招募券，使用</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">招募券</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以自主扩充您的探险队伍，或将命运交给运气，通过</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">“临时招募”</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">偶遇罗德岛派出的干员（不必自己获得）也是一种选择。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">在初始招募时，可以招募好友的助战干员协助作战。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">干员在第一次被招募时，只能发挥出最多精英化阶段1的实力（等级、天赋、技能解锁与专精等级、模组等）。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">重复招募同一干员可以使其</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">“进阶”</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，干员</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">“进阶”</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">后将解除上述显示，同步为普通游戏模式中的状态。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·</span></strong></span> <span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">节点介绍</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"169\" alt=\"3-1-3.png\" title=\"3-1-3.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/182d7d139d37b18f7fefb8e2a4726ea5.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">诡意行商</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以消耗源石锭购买道具、收藏品和通宝的商店，有时还提供特别的投资服务。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">......或许，</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">可以“免费”获得这些商品？   </span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">命运所指</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">在这里，</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">将来到重要的抉择时刻。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">指点迷津</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在此节点内，您可以选择使用已留存的招募券进行特别招募，节省招募或进阶干员所需的希望消耗，并使招募到的干员成为伺烛客。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您也可以选择进入一场特殊的秉烛仪式，仪式开始前您需要自行选择需要成为伺烛客的干员，并将其部署在明烛台上接受考验，干员在倒计时结束前坚持住不被击退便可直接成为伺烛客。考验期间，您也可以部署其他干员来协助其通过考验。仪式失败不会导致探索结束，大胆尝试吧！</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">误入奇境</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">遇到该类节点，可以选择获得一定烛火，步入岁兽残识。消耗烛火可以自由选择岁兽残识中的节点进行探索，获得更丰富的资源，提升小队实力。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失与得</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">有时候，</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">所不需要的物品或许是别人赖以生存的宝物。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">在此</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">可将不再需要的收藏品拿去置换有用的珍贵资源。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">古今学识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中点亮相关加成后，还会出现更多</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">全新节点</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">，期待</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您的</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">光临 。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">狭路相逢</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">在此节点内</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">可以选择进入一场特殊的战斗。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">根据是否击败所选目标敌人以及是否有敌人进入保护目标产生不同结果。 不同的结果将会给予</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">不同的奖励。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">此处敌人进入保护目标时不会扣除生命值或护盾值。因此大胆选择对手吧！  </span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">先行一步</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">可在此节点指定一名干员脱离队伍提前探险，在本层中该干员不可使用。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在进入下一层时该干员将回归队伍，获得晋升并带回额外奖励。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·</span></strong></span> <span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">局内属性</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"170\" alt=\"3-1-4.png\" title=\"3-1-4.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/6c03c9ec1db0a3bf6ea2a263e48bac31.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">目标生命值</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">目标生命值不会超过目标生命上限。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">护盾值</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">保护玩家目标生命减少的消耗性资源。存在护盾时，作战中损失目标生命时将会优先扣除护盾值。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">希望</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">希望是招募和进阶干员的重要资源。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">可以在探险过程中，通过作战来提升指挥等级，从而获得更多的希望 。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">票券</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">票券是本期新增的重要资源，可通过战斗掉落、事件探索、支援奖励、岁兽残识中的易与节点处购买等多种途径获得。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在探险过程中，可消耗票券重新投钱、打开竖直通路、刷新诡意行商或易与节点的商品。</span></span></span><br/></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·</span></span> <span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">收藏品</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"171\" alt=\"3-1-5.png\" title=\"3-1-5.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/d57dffced90b98c5c4b8695a061a9498.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">收藏品数量众多，效果各异，是探险途中获得的主要物品。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">部分未知收藏品拥有额外的解锁条件。随着</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">探险的不断深入，这些收藏品将会被逐步解锁（解锁时可同时获得</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">迷路幼伥</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">）。解锁后，才可在后续的探险中获得。</span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在本次</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异】</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">集成战略主题中，</span>当请君入园的等级达到</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">3、6、9</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">级时<span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">，多元奇物类别的收藏品效果将会一步步被强化。强化后效果只会在达到对应难度的探险中生效。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·</span></strong></span> <span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">探险结算</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"172\" alt=\"3-1-6.png\" title=\"3-1-6.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/7901c2b83c009a29568ae53de68cef2a.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">无论是获得最终胜利还是在中途止步，在探险中招募到的干员、获得的物品、战斗的经历等，都会计入本次探险的分数，分数会转换成</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">迷路幼伥</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，可用于提升</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游园纪念</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的等级。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">同时，</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">还会在探险中获得可用于点亮</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">古今学识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点的</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失落智识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。点亮</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">古今学识</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">节点不仅可以永久提升</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">的探险实力，还拥有解锁分队流派，拓展探险功能等效果，使</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">在后续的探险中获得更多样化的体验。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">需要注意的是，当</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">古今学识</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">的等级到达当前最高等级后，</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">将不会继续获得</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失落智识</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">，但</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在探险旅程中仍能获得</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">迷路幼伥</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·</span></strong></span> <span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">主题更新方式</span></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">集成战略主题更新期间，除首月外，每月将会进行包含</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">游园纪念</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游览者列表</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">本月委托栏</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在内的内容更新。</span></span></p><p><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">除此之外，在</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">集成战略主题更新期间，还将进行多次内容拓展，届时期待<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>的挑战。</span></span></p>",
    "displayTime": "2025-07-16",
